@@ -31,6 +31,13 @@ Add the new instance setting:
     // Redis instance name.
     $settings['redis.connection']['instance']  = 'instance_name';
 
+Each sentinel is tried in turn until one of them returns the master. The
+connection timeout for a sentinel is 0.5 seconds by default, and can be
+changed with the sentinel_timeout setting:
+
+    // Sentinel connection timeout in seconds.
+    $settings['redis.connection']['sentinel_timeout'] = 2;
+
 Connect via UNIX socket
